## AI Agent Reasoning

### Context
Issue #82 makes large-folder indexing observable without replacing a usable workspace before a scan succeeds.

### Decisions Made
- Commit candidate scans atomically so cancellation and failures preserve the live workspace.
- Yield before and during indexing so the Explorer spinner can paint and animate.
- Use a request ID to prevent stale scans from replacing newer workspace state.

### Trade-offs
- The full tree and file fingerprints remain eagerly indexed for compatibility; lazy expansion is explicitly out of scope for this issue.

